// niri config for the Arch side.
//
// This is a deliberate subset of niri's stock config: the compositor's own
// defaults are not read when a config exists, so the binds that make the
// session usable are restated here, and the hardware keys the user asked for
// are set explicitly.
//
// Mod is Super. keyd maps CapsLock to Meta, so either key works.
//
// config.kdl is generated from this directory. Edit these files, then rebuild:
//
//     bun run niri-split
//
// The splitter is vendored at bootstrap/tools/niri-split (MIT). It merges
// `layout`, `input`, `binds` and `animations` into one block each and appends
// everything else in filename order.
